[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=CachyOS DailyTool
GenericName=System tool
GenericName[de]=Systemwerkzeug
Comment=Wine prefixes, launcher migration, ProtonPlus, X3D core assignment (CCD), mount drives, GPU status, logs, shader caches, system update
